rs vivid, high-resolution digital content ideal for trade shows, retail promotions, and temporary outdoor or indoor installations. An optional battery enhances mobility, making it a premier choice for dynamic event environments.\", \"sku\": \"BL-RDY-PRT25\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/portable-led-stand-p25\", \"category\": \"ready-made\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_portable-led-stand-p25.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 2000, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/portable-led-stand-p25\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"2.5mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"1,000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the Portable LED Stand P2.5 and why does it matter?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 2.5mm, which offers high resolution and sharp image quality, ideal for close viewing distances at events and retail environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the display and can it be used outdoors?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display has a brightness of 1,000 nits, which provides clear visibility in well-lit indoor settings and shaded outdoor areas, though direct harsh sunlight may affect visibility.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How quickly can it be set up and what does installation involve?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Setup takes approximately 5 minutes with minimal tools needed. The wheeled stand provides easy mobility and quick positioning, making it ideal for fast event deployments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a battery option available for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the Portable LED Stand P2.5 offers a battery option for untethered, mobile use, perfect for temporary installations where power outlets are not accessible.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the weight of the unit and is it truly portable?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The unit weighs 28kg with the stand, which, combined with its wheeled design, makes it easy to transport and relocate by one or two people.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare to traditional fixed LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This portable unit offers mobility and rapid setup compared to fixed LED displays, making it more versatile for temporary events, promotions, and trade shows without compromising on image quality.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of warranty does the Portable LED Stand P2.5 come with?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a standard manufacturer warranty covering hardware defects and performance issues, ensuring peace of mind with your purchase.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this LED poster be customized for different content or branding needs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it supports dynamic digital content through compatible media players, allowing you to display customized graphics, videos, and branding to engage your audience effectively.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Portable LED Stand P2.5\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/portable-led-stand-p25\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>Portable LED Stand P2.5</h1><p>Discover the Portable LED Stand P2.5 for vibrant mobile displays in Dubai. Order now for high-impact visuals across UAE events.</p><p><strong>Portable LED poster with wheeled stand. Ideal for events and retail.</strong></p><p>The Portable LED Stand P2.5 is a compact, wheeled LED poster designed for easy transport and rapid setup in just 5 minutes. Featuring a sharp 2.5mm pixel pitch and 1,000 nits brightness, it delivers vivid, high-resolution digital content ideal for trade shows, retail promotions, and temporary outdoor or indoor installations. An optional battery enhances mobility, making it a premier choice for dynamic event environments.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the Portable LED Stand P2.5 and why does it matter?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 2.5mm, which offers high resolution and sharp image quality, ideal for close viewing distances at events and retail environments.</p><h3>How bright is the display and can it be used outdoors?</h3><p>The display has a brightness of 1,000 nits, which provides clear visibility in well-lit indoor settings and shaded outdoor areas, though direct harsh sunlight may affect visibility.</p><h3>How quickly can it be set up and what does installation involve?</h3><p>Setup takes approximately 5 minutes with minimal tools needed. The wheeled stand provides easy mobility and quick positioning, making it ideal for fast event deployments.</p><h3>Is there a battery option available for this LED display?</h3><p>Yes, the Portable LED Stand P2.5 offers a battery option for untethered, mobile use, perfect for temporary installations where power outlets are not accessible.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"products\\\",\\\"portable-led-stand-p25\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"products/portable-led-stand-p25\\\",\\\"c\\\",[\\\"products\\\"]],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"script-0\\\",{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\",\\\"async\\\":true,\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"html\\\",null,{\\\"lang\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"childr