 Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n15:T68d,\\u003ch1\\u003ePortable LED Stand P2.5\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eDiscover the Portable LED Stand P2.5 for vibrant mobile displays in Dubai. Order now for high-impact visuals across UAE events.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003ePortable LED poster with wheeled stand. Ideal for events and retail.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe Portable LED Stand P2.5 is a compact, wheeled LED poster designed for easy transport and rapid setup in just 5 minutes. Featuring a sharp 2.5mm pixel pitch and 1,000 nits brightness, it delivers vivid, high-resolution digital content ideal for trade shows, retail promotions, and temporary outdoor or indoor installations. An optional battery enhances mobility, making it a premier choice for dynamic event environments.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the pixel pitch of the Portable LED Stand P2.5 and why does it matter?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe pixel pitch is 2.5mm, which offers high resolution and sharp image quality, ideal for close viewing distances at events and retail environments.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow bright is the display and can it be used outdoors?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe display has a brightness of 1,000 nits, which provides clear visibility in well-lit indoor settings and shaded outdoor areas, though direct harsh sunlight may affect visibility.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow quickly can it be set up and what does installation involve?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eSetup takes approximately 5 minutes with minimal tools needed. The wheeled stand provides easy mobility and quick positioning, making it ideal for fast event deployments.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eIs there a battery option available for this LED display?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes, the Portable LED Stand P2.5 offers a battery option for untethered, mobile use, perfect for temporary installations where power outlets are not accessible.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Portable LED Stand P2.5 - Premium Mobile LED Display Dubai | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Discover the Portable LED Stand P2.5 for vibrant mobile displays in Dubai. Order now for high-impact visuals across UAE events.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/portable-led-stand-p25\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nc:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\ne:I[68027,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\",1]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n9:X\n0:{\"P\":null,\"c\":[\"\",\"products\",\"portable-led-stand-p25\"],\"q\":\"\",\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[[\"slug\",\"products/portable-led-stand-p25\",\"c\",[\"products\"]],{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4608]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4608]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4624],[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"chi