: \"1,000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Ta1a,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the Portable LED Stand P2.5 and why does it matter?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 2.5mm, which offers high resolution and sharp image quality, ideal for close viewing distances at events and retail environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the display and can it be used outdoors?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display has a brightness of 1,000 nits, which provides clear visibility in well-lit indoor settings and shaded outdoor areas, though direct harsh sunlight may affect visibility.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How quickly can it be set up and what does installation involve?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Setup takes approximately 5 minutes with minimal tools needed. The wheeled stand provides easy mobility and quick positioning, making it ideal for fast event deployments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a battery option available for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the Portable LED Stand P2.5 offers a battery option for untethered, mobile use, perfect for temporary installations where power outlets are not accessible.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the weight of the unit and is it truly portable?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The unit weighs 28kg with the stand, which, combined with its wheeled design, makes it easy to transport and relocate by one or two people.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare to traditional fixed LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This portable unit offers mobility and rapid setup compared to fixed LED displays, making it more versatile for temporary events, promotions, and trade shows without compromising on image quality.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of warranty does the Portable LED Stand P2.5 come with?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a standard manufacturer warranty covering hardware defects and performance issues, ensuring peace of mind with your purchase.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this LED poster be customized for different content or branding needs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it supports dynamic digital content through compatible media players, allowing you to display customized graphics, videos, and branding to engage your audience effectively.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Portable LED Stand P2.5\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/portable-led-stand-p25\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T68d,<h1>Portable LED Stand P2.5</h1><p>Discover the Portable LED Stand P2.5 for vibrant mobile displays in Dubai. Order now for high-impact visuals across UAE events.</p><p><strong>Portable LED poster with wheeled stand. Ideal for events and retail.</strong></p><p>The Portable LED Stand P2.5 is a compact, wheeled LED poster designed for easy transport and rapid setup in just 5 minutes. Featuring a sharp 2.5mm pixel pitch and 1,000 nits brightness, it delivers vivid, high-resolution digital content ideal for trade shows, retail promotions, and temporary outdoor or indoor installations. An optional battery enhances mobility, making it a premier choice for dynamic event environments.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the Portable LED Stand P2.5 and why does it matter?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 2.5mm, which offers high resolution and sharp image quality, ideal for close viewing distances at events and retail environments.</p><h3>How bright is the display and can it be used outdoors?</h3><p>The display has a brightness of 1,000 nits, which provides clear visibility in well-lit indoor settings and shaded outdoor areas, though direct harsh sunlight may affect visibility.</p><h3>How quickly can it be set up and what does installation involve?</h3><p>Setup takes approximately 5 minutes with minimal tools needed. The wheeled stand provides easy mobility and quick positioning, making it ideal for fast event deployments.</p><h3>Is there a battery option available for this LED display?</h3><p>Yes, the Portable LED Stand P2.5 offers a battery option for untethered, mobile use, perfect for temporary installations where power outlets are not accessible.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"na